(1, 1, '3952374135780641616_19392348324', 'DbZp1X-pYtQ', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DbZp1X-pYtQ', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 2, '☕✨ Satu Teguk, Sejuta Semangat!\n\nSiapa bilang kopi enak harus mahal? 😎\nDi Be Nice Coffee Kartini Jepara, kamu bisa nikmatin kopi berkualitas dengan harga yang tetap bersahabat di kantong.\n\nKarena setiap tegukan bukan cuma soal rasa, tapi juga jadi penyemangat untuk menjalani hari. 💪🤎\n\n📍 Be Nice Coffee Kartini Jepara\n☕ Kopi enak\n💸 Harga ramah\n😊 Bikin mood langsung naik!\n\n#BeNiceCoffee #BeNiceCoffeeKartini #Jepara #KopiMurah KopiEnak NgopiJepara CoffeeLovers SatuTegukSejutaSemangat NgopiHemat KulinerJepara', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/760443625_1685259899198568_2663732420323800236_n.jpg?stp=c0.248.640.640a_dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=wtIA7vR9LAMQ7kNvwErte1g&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQJZV8RqvNSQherlPmVehFPdn-7niqivhQ4naD1EWqBqlA&oe=6AB3DF3D&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1785379893, 5, 0, 357, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(2, 1, '3943241256203285798_4361771108', 'Da5NQfDqXUm', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/Da5NQfDqXUm', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 2, 'Grand opening @benicecoffeeid @benicecoffee.kartini \n\nNgopi enak nggak harus mahal!\nKini Hadir di jepara benice coffe\n\nTemukan menu favorit kamu di sini\n🤎 Coffee\n💚 Matcha\n🍓 Strawberry\n🍫 Chocolate\n.\nBuka setiap hari\nLokasi: jln kartini jepara', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/749515267_27611859375120857_939580912463352631_n.jpg?stp=c0.248.640.640a_dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=XWWRQIUQV3EQ7kNvwHT3MBr&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQJEPcXYQuQJUkfJbpFVRQFN3c0XWXGM1Dmtx6UOVJ4TrA&oe=6AB3E024&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1784291270, 165, 5, 44526, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(3, 1, '3940850135395262805_19392348324', 'DawtlGRSOFV', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DawtlGRSOFV', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, '🤎 Ngopi enak nggak harus mahal!\n\nLagi pengen yang manis, creamy, atau seger? Di Be Nice Coffee ada banyak pilihan menu mulai dari Rp5.000 aja! ☕✨\n\nMau yang favorit kamu yang mana nih?\n🤎 Coffee\n💚 Matcha\n🍓 Strawberry\n🍫 Chocolate\n🥛 Taro\n...atau menu lainnya?\n\nTulis jawabanmu di kolom komentar ya! 👇\nSiapa tahu besok jadi menu yang kamu cobain. 😉\n\n📍 Benice Coffee Kartini\n🕒 Buka setiap hari\n📲 Follow @benicecoffee.kartini biar nggak ketinggalan promo dan menu terbaru!\n\n#BeniceCoffee #BeniceCoffeeKartini #KopiSemarang #CoffeeLovers #NgopiMurah EsKopi KulinerSemarang JajanSemarang MinumanHits CoffeeTime', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/747827264_18126391909644325_630990347662707767_n.jpg?stp=c0.169.1351.1351a_dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=3GD38Sub428Q7kNvwE6b44V&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzk0MDg1MDEzNTM5NTI2MjgwNQ%3D%3D.3.c-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQK3SFVULfgH6ykGLsLuPeu6WGhenob71dTJdXvdMdKkkg&oe=6AB3D2A3&_nc_si', 1784005993, 7, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(4, 1, '3939271341442033701_19392348324', 'DarGmn0h2gl', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DarGmn0h2gl', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, 'Satu teguk, sejuta semangat. ☕🔥\n\nAda hari yang berat, tapi selalu ada kopi yang bikin semangat balik lagi.\n\nNikmati kesegaran dan cita rasa khas dari Be Nice Coffee. Cocok buat nemenin kerja, kuliah, nongkrong, atau sekadar recharge di tengah hari.\n\nKarena setiap tegukan selalu punya cerita. ❤️\n\n📍Yuk mampir ke Be Nice Coffee Kartini Jepara \n\n#BeNiceCoffee #EnjoyYourEspresso #CoffeeTime #KopiKekinian #EsKopi NgopiYuk KopiIndonesia CoffeeLover DailyCoffee SemangatHariIni', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/746729856_18125871832644325_6193923577880332695_n.jpg?stp=c0.169.1351.1351a_dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=ipMElGfyd1wQ7kNvwGMtPeH&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzOTI3MTM0MTQ0MjAzMzcwMQ%3D%3D.3.c-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQJ4wEvSiz8zI1J3KqRHErm-XGh52VeSNf2mhZlhc4OX_A&oe=6AB3E657&_nc_s', 1783817781, 8, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(5, 1, '3936657287455494697_19392348324', 'Dah0PIVPNIp', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/Dah0PIVPNIp', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, 'Yuk hari gini mah enaknya yang seger seger 🎉🎉', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/736576401_18124998679644325_5197366841787136351_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=-LSUI3KsK_cQ7kNvwEtoLmi&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNjY1NzI4NzQ1NTQ5NDY5Nw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQK3GUrrsFBPTSlLLa4RtkwsU7SG9su5V2ySSFKkUjeNhA&oe=6AB3C457&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1783506192, 6, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(6, 1, '3936074361449329685_19392348324', 'DafvscLtbQV', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DafvscLtbQV', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, '✨ SWEET, CREAMY, AND UNFORGETTABLE ✨\n\nKenalan dengan menu favorit baru dari Be Nice Coffee 🤎☕\n\nButterscotch Coffee Latte hadir dengan perpaduan espresso yang bold, creamy milk, dan manisnya butterscotch yang lembut. Setiap tegukan memberikan rasa caramel-like yang bikin nagih ✨\n\nCocok buat nemenin kerja, belajar, atau sekadar santai bareng orang tersayang 🤍\n\nYuk cobain sensasi manis dan creamy-nya di Be Nice Coffee! 🧋\n\nSatu Teguk, Sejuta Semangat ❤️\n\n#BeNiceCoffee #ButterscotchCoffeeLatte #CoffeeLovers #CoffeeJepara #NgopiJepara CafeJepara KulinerJepara CoffeeTime', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/741447038_18124819738644325_1206094366731093075_n.jpg?stp=c1.0.1438.1438a_dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=ZTB_b0FcZUwQ7kNvwHF6BAa&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNjA3NDM2MTQ0OTMyOTY4NQ%3D%3D.3.c-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQLd0a-fWlP16ZU-8Skkq6y2_OWUyC7tOSut3AL_4cULSg&oe=6AB3E50D&_nc_sid', 1783436674, 4, 1, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(7, 1, '3936073739250080673_19392348324', 'DafvjYtvpuh', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DafvjYtvpuh', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, '🎉☕ GRAND OPENING BE NICE COFFEE! ☕🎉\n\nDalam rangka Grand Opening, ada promo spesial buat kamu! 🔥\n\n✨ BAYAR 2 DAPAT 3 ✨\n🎁 Free 1 varian Non Coffee\n\n📅 Periode: 8 - 10 Juli 2026\n📍 Kartini Media Printing, Jepara\n\nSyarat & ketentuan:\n1️⃣ Follow Instagram @benicecoffee.kartini\n2️⃣ Upload story Be Nice Coffee\n3️⃣ Tag @benicecoffee.kartini di story kamu\n\nAjak teman, keluarga, dan orang tersayang untuk ikut merayakan hari spesial ini! ❤️\n\nSatu Teguk, Sejuta Semangat. ☕✨\n\n#BeNiceCoffee #GrandOpening #CoffeeJepara #KulinerJepara #NgopiJepara CafeJepara JeparaHits CoffeeLovers', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/733749678_18124819585644325_7704430061891529382_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=uPH5ZKCC61sQ7kNvwG87I-p&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNjA3MzczOTI1MDA4MDY3Mw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQKWnQj8yn4CmYgku7Uyfu8Eh7VGn50xzRQePGP_AyZIvQ&oe=6AB3CBEF&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1783436601, 14, 1, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(8, 1, '3936073101242494079_19392348324', 'DafvaGhh2x_', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DafvaGhh2x_', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, 'Lagi butuh mood booster? 👀✨\n\nSatu teguk Be Nice Coffee bisa jadi solusi kesegaranmu hari ini 🤎💚\n\nMau kopi? Ada.\nMau yang fresh & creamy? Ada juga! 🧋\n\nCus mampir dan temukan minuman favoritmu di Be Nice Coffee ☕✨\n\n#BeNiceCoffee #JeparaHits #NgopiYuk #CoffeeLover', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/736227983_18124819348644325_1553338817979364632_n.jpg?stp=c0.169.1351.1351a_dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=Eq_t91sH750Q7kNvwFHEnZh&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNjA3MzEwMTI0MjQ5NDA3OQ%3D%3D.3.c-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQI1X7xbBIgOJg9j9RF59DAbo0HUJEUReiUsQi7QJs4kHQ&oe=6AB3B727&_nc_s', 1783436504, 5, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(9, 1, '3935854860804542316_19392348324', 'Dae9ySRv89s', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/Dae9ySRv89s', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, '🚨 SOFT OPENING HARI INI! 🚨\n\nHalo Jepara! 👋\nBe Nice Coffee resmi mulai melayani hari ini!\n\nDatang, cobain menu favoritmu, dan rasakan semangat di setiap tegukan. ☕❤️\n\n📍 Kartini Media Printing, Jepara\n📅 Selasa, 7 Juli 2026\n\nJangan lupa ajak orang tersayang ya! Sampai ketemu di Be Nice Coffee. ✨', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/734275068_18124739446644325_1181981394885201733_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=Bgfi2IH5cMgQ7kNvwH5gzmu&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNTg1NDg2MDgwNDU0MjMxNg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQLlD4UKugnVmXmI-4SK4chjmJhJqksCWk2RSlDkrcQJTQ&oe=6AB3B40D&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1783410529, 11, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(10, 1, '3935766159416414881_19392348324', 'DaepngrBNKh', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DaepngrBNKh', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, 'The perfect sip? As perfect as KIM SEON HO❤️\n\nKalau lagi butuh mood booster, jawabannya simpel:\n☕ Be Nice Coffee.\n\nKarena setiap tegukan bukan cuma tentang kopi, tapi juga semangat untuk menjalani hari. ✨\n\n📍 Be Nice Coffee Jepara\n🗓️ Opening 08 Juli 2026\n\nYuk jadi salah satu pelanggan pertama kami! Ajak bestie, pasangan, atau teman nongkrongmu buat nyobain menu favorit di Be Nice Coffee.\n\nSatu Teguk, Sejuta Semangat. ❤️\n\n#BeNiceCoffee #BeNiceCoffeeJepara #OpeningSoon #Jepara #NgopiJepara CoffeeLover StayNice SatuTegukSejutaSemangat', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/742284811_18124713823644325_4598499635786680543_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=b5w7gXRrmVYQ7kNvwHbj2iy&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNTc2NjE1OTQxNjQxNDg4MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQLUsdG-14Dl3j20l3E0FXfQffLojFsDqwLcqlaEMxEn5g&oe=6AB3E799&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1783399942, 8, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
(11, 1, '3935760224060415175_19392348324', 'DaeoRI8O5zH', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DaeoRI8O5zH', '19392348324', 'benicecoffee.kartini', 'Be Nice Coffee', 1, '🚨 OPENING SOON! 🚨\n\nHalo, Jepara! 👋\nAda tempat ngopi baru yang siap nemenin harimu. ☕❤️\n\n📅 08 Juli 2026\n📍 Jl. Kartini, Panggang I, Jepara (Depan Kartini Media Printing)\n\n✨ Menu enak\n✨ Harga ramah di kantong\n✨ Cocok buat kerja, atau sekadar recharge\n\nTag teman yang wajib kamu ajak ke sini ya! 👇\n\n#BeNiceCoffee #Jepara #OpeningSoon #NgopiJepara #CoffeeTime', 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/741409291_18124712140644325_8297797475568403592_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGyv5FEj1b5QRBM_NoZZf79Cv2Ivch-ZaKBVQLwFm7PpgX3oggcEJw7F-swoNg5rV0&_nc_ohc=MZs2exOA3vAQ7kNvwH25xQK&_nc_gid=CPDPCWz3LhK4D8wX8lVBrg&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzkzNTc2MDIyNDA2MDQxNTE3NQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQIj2Vq_6KaNQHfMyP6uu5zqI7EyFluSSLOiXNA5qg9sLw&oe=6AB3EA48&_nc_sid=ee9879', 1783399458, 5, 0, 0, '2026-09-19 03:06:35'),
