(29, 1, '3993041230040911289_27265196708', 'DdqIde6E825', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DdqIde6E825', '27265196708', 'benicecoffee_trubus', 'Wella Natalia', 8, '💜 REAL PURPLE. REAL SWEET. 🍵✨\n\nMeet our new seasonal drink — Ube Halaya Matcha 💜\nCreamy ube halaya yang manis legit, dipadukan dengan earthy & smooth-nya pure matcha.\n\nSatu cup, dua karakter yang ternyata… cocok banget! 🥹💜\n\n✨ Seasonal Menu — limited time only\n📍 Benice Coffee Trubus\n📲 @benicecoffee_trubus\n\n#BeniceCoffee #UbeHalayaMatcha #UbeMatcha #MatchaLover #UbeLover SeasonalMenu MatchaLatte', 'https://scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/818321308_18121819795908709_1074067658167246589_n.jpg?stp=c0.192.1152.1152a_dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFmUFgPesamZi8jJUmnhrM3gt9ebWvka8d3GCZEeKtA42hM3x9R6wGhUTDtrEkr5Ck&_nc_ohc=ipiD0mHGoZEQ7kNvwHQg0Qw&_nc_gid=RMLjeJE_WUVKLKxBgaKqCQ&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzk5MzA0MTExOTk5NDQ4MTgxMQ%3D%3D.3.c-ccb7-5&oh=00_AQNe5Ued9W-wuYFaJWIISkBHHQ3ft53AmhfuyEe8cd2Wzg&oe=6ACE2C87&_nc_s', 1790227629, 4, 0, 0, '2026-10-09 01:54:06'),
